%% Register, sign in and create a family. Claude rewrites this via /update-diagrams.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor P as New person
  participant W as Web app
  participant A as API
  participant D as SQLite

  P->>W: name, email and password on the register page
  W->>A: POST /api/v1/auth/register (anonymous, rate limited)
  A->>D: is the email already registered?
  alt email already registered
    A-->>W: 400 with an email error
  else new email
    A->>D: create the account with the default User role
    A-->>W: 204 No Content
    W-->>P: go to sign in
  end
  P->>W: sign in as usual
  P->>W: Create family, then New family for another one
  W->>A: POST /api/v1/families
  A->>D: add the family, the person as its Owner and the default categories
  A-->>W: the new family, which becomes the active one
  Note over W: the header selector switches between the person's families
